.TH SYNAPSE-SENSOR 1 "2026" "synapseids" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
synapse-sensor \- SynapseIDS distributed capture agent (placeholder)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B synapse-sensor version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B synapse-sensor
is a placeholder for the lightweight remote capture agent described in
.BR PROJECT.md " \[char167] 5.3."
Distributed sensors \(em an authenticated, encrypted transport with
.BR raw ", " flow " and " feature
modes, reconnect, and sensor/location identity \(em are planned for Phase 6.
.PP
Until then this binary only reports its version so that packaging and release
tooling can treat all three SynapseIDS commands uniformly. Any other invocation
prints guidance and exits non\-zero.
.PP
For now, capture on the daemon host or feed
.B synapsed
a capture file:
.PP
.RS
.B synapse replay ./capture.pcap \-\-speed 2
.RE
.SH EXIT STATUS
.B 0
for
.BR version ;
.B 1
otherwise.
